36535>>>>>>>        Move (DateSetMinute(dtTime, (Integer(sMinutes)))) to dtTime
36536>>>>>>>        Move (DateSetSecond(dtTime, (Integer(sSeconds)))) to dtTime
36537>>>>>>>        
36537>>>>>>>        Function_Return dtTime
